Rule 1 (tensor must be at least 1-dimensional to be sorted)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 3 (keys list of tensors must contain at least one element)
{v_1 : list(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 1
>>
Rule 4 (keys tuple of tensors must contain at least one element)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 1
>>
Rule 5 (tensor must not have a complex data type for lexicographical sorting)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) < 9
>>
Rule 6 (the dimension along which to sort must have a size greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 then shape(v_1, v_2) > 0 else shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_2) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (axis must be a valid dimension index for the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 + ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 13 (input tensor should have at least 1 dimension and non-empty last dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0
>>
Rule 14 (sorting axis must be a valid index relative to the input tensor's dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then v_2 + ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 else v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 15 (keys list of tensors must contain between 2 and 50 elements)
{v_1 : list(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 2 ∧ v_1.len < 50
>>
Rule 16 (keys tuple of tensors must contain between 2 and 50 elements)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 2 ∧ v_1.len < 50
>>
Rule 17 (input tensor must have a non-complex data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 18 (keys as a list of tensors must have a length between 1 and 64)
{v_1 : list(tensor)} |= v_1.len > 0 ∧ v_1.len < 64
>>
Rule 19 (keys as a tuple of tensors must have a length between 1 and 64)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= v_1.len > 0 ∧ v_1.len < 64
>>
Rule 20 (sorting axis must be valid and the corresponding dimension size must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= (v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) ∧ shape(v_1, v_2) > 0) ∨ (v_2 < 0 ∧ v_2 + ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_2) > 0)
>>
Rule 21 (tensor data type must be a sortable type: non-complex and not np.dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8) ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 11
>>
Rule 22 (the rank of the input tensor to be sorted must be within a reasonable range)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_1) < 6
